  "note": "Pingtang Bridge with three white-and-blue split-head pylons, paired cable planes, a 2.1 km divided deck, the approach trestles and the two southwest S62 tunnel mouths. The 703.75 m reference datum at the central pylon footing puts the deck from 882.9 m at the southwest portals to 904.85 m at the northeast bank. Standard Terrarium establishes the pier contact and bank grades. The deck grade is an exterior fit and has not been surveyed. Preview places the authored base at the recorded absolute sea-level elevation; local tide and terrain resolution remain host-dependent."
